      <p class="welcome-lead">Inshore, nearshore, offshore and crappie trips across Tampa Bay with a team of local captains, from $550 per boat.</p>
      <p>Maybe it's your kid's first redfish on a calm morning in the mangroves. Maybe it's a cooler of snapper and grouper off Gulf bottom, or a tarpon jumping beside the boat in July.</p>
      <p>Our team of captains fishes all of Tampa Bay, Florida's largest open water estuary, from the grass flats and mangroves around Ruskin to the passes near St. Petersburg and out into the Gulf, plus the lakes near Orlando. So whatever you have in mind and whenever you can get away, one of our captains is already out there doing it.</p>
